e": "How to Get Gemini 3 Pro Free for 1 Year (US Students Guide 2025)", "page_content": "Gemini 3于2025年11月18日发布。此次更新带来了更强的编程能力、更长的上下文窗口，以及一个全新的图像模型NanoBanana Pro。由于这些升级，Google DeepMind将其描述为迄今为止最强大的Gemini模型。\\n上述段落英文原文为：Gemini 3 was released on November 18, 2025 . This update brings stronger coding skills, a longer context window, and a brand-new image model called NanoBanana Pro . Because of these upgrades, Google DeepMind has described it as the most powerful Gemini model so far.\\nGoogle再次向符合条件的大学生免费提供Google AI Pro服务。目标是降低使用AI的成本，让学生能够更轻松地将其用于学习、研究和未来职业发展。这也有助于Gemini触达更多年轻用户。\\n上述段落英文原文为：Google is once again offering Google AI Pro for free to eligible college students . The goal is to reduce the cost of using AI, so students can rely on it more easily for studying, research, and future careers. It also helps Gemini reach more young users.\\n获取服务很简单。完成简单的学生身份验证后，符合条件的用户即可激活Google AI Pro，免费使用整整一年。\\n上述段落英文原文为：Getting access is easy. After completing a simple student verification, eligible users can activate Google AI Pro and use it for free for one full year.\\n如果您想了解详细信息，请继续阅读。本指南将带您了解如何申请Google Gemini大学生计划，非学生如何仍可免费使用Gemini，以及在注册和使用过程中需要注意的关键事项，让您以更低的成本尝试高级AI工具。\\n上述段落英文原文为：If you want the full details, keep reading. This guide will walk you through how to apply as a Google Gemini college student , how non-students can still use Gemini for free, and the key things to watch out for during signup and use, so you can try advanced AI at a lower cost.\\n<quark-heading level=\"2\">什么是面向大学生的Gemini？</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"2\">What Is Gemini for College Students?</quark-heading>\\n面向大学生的Gemini项目是Google面向全球52个国家和地区的大学生提供的官方服务，包括美国、法国和韩国。通过SheerID学生身份验证后，符合条件的学生可免费使用Google AI Pro整整12个月。\\n上述段落英文原文为：The Gemini for College Students program is an official offer from Google for university students in 52 countries and regions , including the United States, France, and South Korea. After passing SheerID student verification , eligible students can use Google AI Pro for free for a full 12 months .\\n在此期间，学生可享受与每月19.99美元标准计划相同的内核功能。这包括使用Gemini 3 Pro、长上下文能力、NotebookLM Plus以及2TB云存储，所有功能都旨在支持学习和工作效率。\\n上述段落英文原文为：During this period, students get the same core features as the $19.99/month standard plan . This includes access to Gemini 3 Pro , long context capabilities, NotebookLM Plus , and 2TB of cloud storage , all designed to support learning and productivity.\\n实际上，面向大学生的Gemini项目为学生提供了价值约240美元的完整AI工具包。可用于撰写论文、整理研究资料、获取编程帮助等任务，让大学生能够更轻松地使用高级AI工具。\\n上述段落英文原文为：In practice, the Gemini student program gives students a complete AI toolkit worth about $240 per year . It can be used for tasks like writing papers, organizing research materials, and getting help with coding, making advanced AI tools much more accessible for college students.\\n<quark-heading level=\"2\">如何免费获得大学生Gemini 3（分步指南）</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"2\">How to Get Gemini 3 Free for College Students (Step by Step)</quark-heading>\\n为了帮助您顺利激活Gemini学生福利，以下是三种经过验证的方法，可在几分钟内解锁免费使用Gemini 3 Pro的权限。\\n上述段落英文原文为：To help you activate your Gemini student benefits smoothly, here are three proven methods that can unlock free access to Gemini 3 Pro in just a few minutes .\\n<quark-heading level=\"3\">方法1：使用个人Google账户申请（推荐）</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"3\">Method 1: Apply with a Personal Google Account (Recommended)</quark-heading>\\n这是Google官方推荐的方法，适用于大多数大学生。流程清晰、稳定且易于操作。\\n上述段落英文原文为：This is the official Google method and works for most college students. It is clear, stable, and easy to follow.\\n1️⃣ 准备您的Google账户\\n上述段落英文原文为：1️⃣ Prepare your Google account\\n使用您的个人Google账户登录（以\\n上述段落英文原文为：Sign in with your personal Google account (ending in\\n<quark-code>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-code>\\n@gmail.com\\n上述段落英文原文为：@gmail.com\\n</quark-code>\\n上述段落英文原文为：</quark-code>\\n结尾）。请勿使用学校发放的教育账户。学校账户仅用于身份验证，无法用于订阅此优惠。\\n上述段落英文原文为：). Do not use a school-issued education account. School accounts are only for identity verification and cannot be used to subscribe to this offer.\\n2️⃣ 访问学生优惠页面\\n上述段落英文原文为：2️⃣ Visit the student offer page\\n前往官方Google One学生优惠页面。点击页面上的\"检查资格\"或\"获取优惠\"按钮。\\n上述段落英文原文为：Go to the official Google One student offer page. Click “Check Eligibility” or “Get Offer” on the page.\\n\\n<quark-ocr>Gemini免费供学生使用Gemini功能订阅服务关于GeminiGoogleGemini：为学生免费提供Pro计划。免费使用一年。获得更多访问权限，包括我们最准确的Gemini 3 Pro模型、无限图像上传、专业级图像生成、定制化测验以及NotebookLM等高级学习工具，还有2TB存储空间。仅限学生使用。获取优惠条款适用</quark-ocr>\\n上述段落英文原文为：\\n<quark-ocr>Gemini Freefor Students WhatGeminiCanDov Subscriptions AboutGemini GoogleGemini: FreeProPlanforStudents. Freefor1year.Getmoreaccess toourmostaccuratemodel Gemini3Pro,unlimited image uploads, Pro-levelimagegeneration,customized quizzesandadvanced learning tools likeNotebookLM,plus 2TBstorage.JustforStudents. Getoffer Terms apply</quark-ocr>\\n3️⃣ 完成SheerID验证\\n上述段落英文原文为：3️⃣ Complete SheerID verification\\n系统将弹出第三方SheerID验证窗口。请输入您的学校信息、全名（必须与学生证或学校系统中的姓名一致）、出生日期和个人邮箱地址。\\n上述段落英文原文为：The system will pop up a third-party verification window for SheerID. Enter your school information, your full name (which must match your student ID or the school system), date of birth, and personal email address.\\n4️⃣ 提交验证\\n上述段落英文原文为：4️⃣ Submit verification\\n大多数情况下验证是即时完成的，系统将自动跳转。如果自动验证失败（例如姓名不匹配），您可能需要上传以下证明材料：\\n上述段落英文原文为：In most cases, verification is instant, and you will move on automatically. If automatic verification fails (for example, due to a name mismatch), you may be asked to upload proof such as:\\n标注当前日期的学生证\\n上述段落英文原文为：A student ID with the current date\\n成绩单\\n上述段落英文原文为：A transcript\\n学费收据\\n上述段落英文原文为：A tuition receipt\\n人工审核通常需要48小时，一旦通过审核，您将收到邮件通知。\\n上述段落英文原文为：Manual review usually takes up to 48 hours , and you will receive an email once approved.\\n5️⃣ 激活订阅\\n上述段落英文原文为：5️⃣ Activate the subscription\\n审核通过后，您将被重定向到Google One结账页面。请确认总金额显示为\"¥0.00\"，这表示学生优惠已成功应用。👉️点击\"订阅\"完成操作。\\n上述段落英文原文为：After approval, you will be redirected to the Google One checkout page. Make sure the total shows “$0.00”, which confirms the student benefit is applied. 👉️Click “Subscribe” to finish.\\n现在您已完全获得Gemini 3 Pro的使用权限。\\n上述段落英文原文为：You now have full access to Gemini 3 Pro .\\n<quark-heading level=\"3\">方法2：使用校园邮箱登录</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"3\">Method 2: Sign In with a Campus Email</quark-heading>\\n此方法适用于您的学校使用Google Workspace for Education服务。\\n上述段落英文原文为：This option works if your school uses Google Workspace for Education .\\n只需在gemini.google.com使用您的\\n上述段落英文原文为：Simply sign in at gemini.google.com using your\\n<quark-code>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-code>\\n.edu\\n上述段落英文原文为：.edu\\n</quark-code>\\n上述段落英文原文为：</quark-code>\\n邮箱地址登录，您可能立即就能免费使用Gemini 3 Pro。\\n上述段落英文原文为：email address, and you may be able to use Gemini 3 Pro for free right away.\\n这种方法的一个主要优势是隐私性更强。对话内容不会用于模型训练，这使其更适合学术和研究工作。\\n上述段落英文原文为：One key advantage of this method is stronger privacy . Conversations are not used for model training, which makes it more suitable for academic and research work.\\n不过，功能访问权限由学校管理员控制。根据学校设置，一些较新或实验性功能可能无法使用。\\n上述段落英文原文为：However, feature access is controlled by your school’s administrator. Some newer or experimental features may not be available, depending on your school’s settings.\\n<quark-heading level=\"3\">方法3：使用VPN访问学生页面</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"3\">Method 3: Use a VPN to Access the Student Page</quark-heading>\\n如果学生优惠页面在您所在地区无法加载或无法显示，此方法很有用。\\n上述段落英文原文为：This method is useful if the student's offer page does not load in your region or is not visible.\\n1️⃣ 连接到美国服务器\\n上述段落英文原文为：1️⃣ Connect to a US server\\n打开NordVPN并连接到美国（US）服务器。\\n上述段落英文原文为：Open NordVPN and connect to a United States (US) server.\\n2️⃣ 打开学生优惠页面\\n上述段落英文原文为：2️⃣ Open the student offer page\\n使用无痕模式的Chrome浏览器，或先清除浏览器缓存和本地存储。然后搜索Google学生优惠页面。\\n上述段落英文原文为：Use Chrome in Incognito mode , or clear your browser cache and local storage first. Then search for the Google student offer page.\\n3️⃣ 完成SheerID验证\\n上述段落英文原文为：3️⃣ Complete SheerID verification\\n像往常一样通过SheerID验证您的学生身份。验证成功后，结账页面应显示¥0.00，完成结账即可激活学生优惠。\\n上述段落英文原文为：Verify your student status through SheerID as usual. Once successful, the checkout page should show $0.00 , and completing checkout will activate the student benefit.\\n💡专业技巧：如何避免一年后被收费\\n上述段落英文原文为：💡 Pro Tip: How to Avoid Charges After One Year If you are worried about being charged after the 12-month free period (the standard price is about $19.99 per month ), you can do this right away: 👉️Go to Google Play → Subscriptions , or open Google One settings. And select “Cancel subscription” In most cases, canceling early will not end your student access immediately. You will keep all benefits until the free period officially ends.\\n如果您担心12个月免费期结束后会被收费（标准价格约为每月¥19.99），您可以立即采取以下措施：👉️前往Google Play → 订阅，或打开Google One设置。然后选择\"取消订阅\"。在大多数情况下，提前取消不会立即终止您的学生访问权限。您将保留所有优惠直到免费期正式结束。\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"2\">How Do I Fix Gemini 3 Student Verification Errors?</quark-heading>\\n<quark-heading level=\"2\">如何修复Gemini 3学生身份验证错误？</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：If your application fails, it does not automatically mean you are not eligible. Most issues are related to account settings or verification steps, not student status itself. Below are the most common problems and how to fix them, so you can complete the process smoothly.\\n如果您的申请失败，不意味着您不符合条件。大多数问题是与账户设置或验证步骤相关，而非学生身份本身。以下是常见问题及解决方案，帮助您顺利完成流程。\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"3\">“Account Not Eligible” Error</quark-heading>\\n<quark-heading level=\"3\">\"账户不符合条件\"错误</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：This message usually does not explain the exact reason. In most cases, it is caused by a subscription conflict , not by your student eligibility. It often happens with older accounts that already use services like Google One, YouTube Premium, or family plans.\\n此消息通常不会说明确切原因。大多数情况下，这是由订阅冲突引起的，而非您的学生身份资格问题。这通常发生在已经使用Google One、YouTube Premium或家庭计划等服务的老账户上。\\n上述段落英文原文为：⛔️ Possible cause: Your account is part of a Google Family Group , or it is linked to another service plan that conflicts with the student offer (such as Google Fi).\\n⛔️可能原因：\\n上述段落英文原文为：Your account is part of a Google Family Group , or it is linked to another service plan that conflicts with the student offer (such as Google Fi).\\n✔️ 解决方法：\\n上述段落英文原文为：✔️ How to fix it:\\n先退出当前家庭组，或者使用未绑定任何共享计划的个人Google账户重新申请。\\n上述段落英文原文为：Leave the current family group first, or apply using a personal Google account that is not tied to any shared plans.\\n<quark-heading level=\"3\">SheerID验证失败</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"3\">SheerID Verification Failed</quark-heading>\\nSheerID验证失败并不意味着你不符合条件。通常是因为系统无法立即找到你的学籍记录。这种情况在小型学校、国际校区或新入学学生中比较常见。\\n上述段落英文原文为：A SheerID failure does not mean you are disqualified. It usually means the automatic system could not find your school record right away. This is common for smaller schools, international campuses, or newly enrolled students.\\n⛔️ 可能原因：\\n上述段落英文原文为：⛔️ Possible cause:\\nSheerID无法通过其数据库即时确认你的入学状态。\\n上述段落英文原文为：SheerID cannot instantly confirm your enrollment through its database.\\n✔️ 解决方法：\\n上述段落英文原文为：✔️ How to fix it:\\n选择手动验证并上传支持文件，例如：\\n上述段落英文原文为：Choose manual verification and upload supporting documents, such as:\\n包含你姓名和当前学期的课程表\\n上述段落英文原文为：A class schedule with your name and the current term\\n缴费收据\\n上述段落英文原文为：A tuition receipt\\n有效学生证\\n上述段落英文原文为：A valid student ID\\n确保照片清晰并显示所有关键信息。清晰的文件有助于加快人工审核速度。\\n上述段落英文原文为：Make sure the photo is clear and shows all key details. Clear documents help speed up manual review.\\n<quark-heading level=\"3\">地区限制或表单输入错误</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"3\">Region Limits or Form Input Errors</quark-heading>\\n即使你是合格的学生，如果所在国家或学校不在当前提供的范围内，流程仍可能失败。\\n上述段落英文原文为：Even if you are a qualified student, the process may fail if your country or school is not included in the current offer.\\n⛔️ 可能原因：\\n上述段落英文原文为：⛔️ Possible cause:\\n学生offer在所有国家或院校中均不可用。\\n上述段落英文原文为：The student offer is not available in all countries or institutions.\\n✔️ 解决方法：\\n上述段落英文原文为：✔️ How to fix it:\\n填写SheerID表单时，始终从下拉列表中选择你的学校，而不是手动输入。\\n上述段落英文原文为：When filling out the SheerID form, always select your school from the dropdown list instead of typing it manually.\\n如果一切看起来都正确但页面仍无法加载，请清除浏览器缓存或使用无痕模式。这通常可以解决由存储的页面数据引起的问题。\\n上述段落英文原文为：If everything looks correct but the page still fails to load, clear your browser cache or use Incognito mode. This often fixes issues caused by stored page data.\\n<quark-heading level=\"3\">账户类型错误</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"3\">Wrong Account Type</quark-heading>\\n这是最常见的被忽视问题之一，特别是对于通常使用学校邮箱登录的用户。\\n上述段落英文原文为：This is one of the most common and overlooked problems, especially for users who usually sign in with a school email.\\n⛔️ 可能原因：\\n上述段落英文原文为：⛔️ Possible cause:\\n你使用了学校发放的\\n上述段落英文原文为：You used a school-issued\\n<quark-code>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-code>\\n.edu\\n上述段落英文原文为：.edu\\n</quark-code>\\n上述段落英文原文为：</quark-code>\\n邮箱地址进行申请。\\n上述段落英文原文为：email address to apply.\\n✔️ 解决方法：\\n上述段落英文原文为：✔️ How to fix it:\\n请使用个人Gmail账户（例如，\\n上述段落英文原文为：Apply and activate the offer using a personal Gmail account (for example,\\n<quark-code>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-code>\\nname@gmail.com\\n上述段落英文原文为：name@gmail.com\\n</quark-code>\\n上述段落英文原文为：</quark-code>\\n）来申请和激活此优惠，不要使用学校账户。\\n上述段落英文原文为：), not a school account.\\n大多数Gemini 3学生身份验证失败并非资格问题。通过检查这些要点——使用个人Gmail账户、离开家庭群组、避免冲突订阅，以及正确完成SheerID验证——您可以快速解决大多数问题。\\n上述段落英文原文为：Most Gemini 3 student verification failures are not eligibility issues. By checking these points—using a personal Gmail account, leaving family groups, avoiding conflicting subscriptions, and completing SheerID verification correctly—you can solve most problems quickly.\\n如果您在多次尝试后仍然无法通过验证，请不要担心。在本指南的后面部分，我们将介绍在不使用学生身份的情况下以更低成本使用Gemini 3的替代方法，这样您就可以继续使用全部功能而不会中断。\\n上述段落英文原文为：If you still cannot pass verification after multiple attempts, don’t worry. Later in this guide, we will introduce alternative ways to use Gemini 3 at a lower cost without student status , so you can continue using the full features without interruption.\\n<quark-heading level=\"2\">Gemini 3学生免费优惠包含什么？</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"2\">What’s Included in the Gemini 3 Student Free Offer?</quark-heading>\\n许多学生申请Gemini学生优惠主要是为了免费试用最新模型。实际上，这个福利的价值远不止于此。一旦激活学生身份，您获得的不仅仅是一个聊天机器人，而是一个为学习和创意工作设计的完整生产力工具包。\\n上述段落英文原文为：Many students apply for the Gemini student offer mainly to try the latest models for free. In reality, this benefit is worth much more than that. Once your student status is activated, you’re not just getting a chatbot—you’re getting a full productivity toolkit designed for study and creative work.\\n<quark-heading level=\"3\">三大高级AI模型</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"3\">Three Advanced AI Models</quark-heading>\\n这是学生计划中最宝贵的部分之一。您可以完全使用三个强大的AI模型，每个模型都针对不同的任务而构建。\\n上述段落英文原文为：This is one of the most valuable parts of the student plan. You get full access to three powerful AI models , each built for different tasks.\\n<quark-table><table><tbody><tr><td>Gemini 3 Pro</td><td>Nano Banana Pro</td><td>Veo 3.1</td></tr><tr><td>最先进的一般用途模型，能够阅读500页教科书，适用于学术写作、代码审查或跨多个文档组织知识</td><td>视觉创作，增强文本识别能力，解决AI在图像中生成错误文本的常见问题，适用于设计、媒体和插画等视觉创作者</td><td>视频生成，支持视频中的原生音频生成，产生逻辑连贯的视频序列，适用于需要对视觉、音频和节奏进行控制的场景</td></tr></tbody></table></quark-table>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-table><table><tbody><tr><td>Gemini 3 Pro</td><td>Nano Banana Pro</td><td>Veo 3.1</td></tr><tr><td>The Most Advanced General-Purpose ModelCapable of reading500 pages of textbooksIdeal foracademic writing, code review, or organizing knowledge across multiple documents</td><td>Visual CreationEnhancedtext recognition capabilitiesSolves the common issue ofAI generating incorrect text in imagesPerfect forvisual creatorsindesign, media, and illustration</td><td>Video GenerationSupportsnative audio generationfor videosProduceslogically coherent video sequencesSuitable for scenarios that requirecontrol over visuals, audio, and pacing</td></tr></tbody></table></quark-table>\\n<quark-heading level=\"3\">海量云存储</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"3\">Massive Cloud Storage</quark-heading>\\n通过Google One学生计划，存储限制不再是问题。您的账户存储空间从标准的15GB增加到2TB。\\n上述段落英文原文为：With the Google One student plan , storage limits are no longer a concern. Your account storage increases from the standard 15GB to 2TB .\\n这个空间涵盖了所有内容——Gmail、Google Photos（原始质量）和Google Drive中的所有文件。您可以安全地将多年的论文、研究数据、小组项目甚至校园活动照片都存放在一个地方。\\n上述段落英文原文为：This space covers everything—Gmail, Google Photos (original quality), and all files in Google Drive. You can safely store years of essays, research data, group projects, and even campus activity photos in one place.\\n<quark-heading level=\"3\">跨所有设备的高级功能</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"3\">Advanced Features Across All Devices</quark-heading>\\n无论您是在笔记本电脑上写论文、平板电脑上记笔记，还是在手机上查找资料，您的Google账户都会让所有内容保持同步。对话记录、保存的内容和重要笔记随时可用。\\n上述段落英文原文为：Whether you’re writing papers on a laptop, taking notes on a tablet, or checking sources on your phone, your Google account keeps everything in sync. Conversations, saved content, and key notes are always available.\\n作为Pro用户，您还可以在考试高峰期获得优先系统访问权限。这有助于避免缓慢的响应或系统过载，确保您最需要的时候工作流程依然顺畅。\\n上述段落英文原文为：As a Pro user, you also get priority system access , even during busy exam periods. This helps avoid slow responses or system overload, so your workflow stays smooth when you need it most.\\n<quark-heading level=\"3\">与Google服务的深度集成</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"3\">Deep Integration with Google Services</quark-heading>\\nGemini可以直接在许多学生已经使用的工具中工作，如Gmail、Docs、Slides和Sheets：\\n上述段落英文原文为：Gemini works directly inside tools many students already use, such as Gmail, Docs, Slides, and Sheets :\\n在Docs中，它可以续写段落或润色学术写作\\n上述段落英文原文为：In Docs , it can continue paragraphs or polish academic writing\\n在Gmail中，简短的提示可以转化为给教授的清晰专业邮件\\n上述段落英文原文为：In Gmail , short prompts can turn into clear, professional emails to professors\\n在演示文稿中，它可以生成大纲甚至视觉想法\\n上述段落英文原文为：For presentations , it can generate outlines and even visual ideas\\n在Sheets中，它帮助编写用于数据分析和实验分析的复杂公式\\n上述段落英文原文为：In Sheets , it helps write complex formulas for data and experiment analysis\\n这种深度集成是Google One学生计划与其他AI助手相比的最大优势之一。\\n上述段落英文原文为：This deep integration is one of the biggest advantages of the Google One student plan compared to other AI assistants.\\n<quark-heading level=\"3\">升级的智能工具</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"3\">Upgraded Smart Tools</quark-heading>\\n除了核心模型外，学生计划还包含节省时间和精力的额外工具：\\n上述段落英文原文为：Beyond the core models, the student plan includes extra tools that save time and effort:\\nNotebookLM Plus：上传更多源文件（PDF、音频、网站）并获得结构化摘要，包括针对复杂主题的播客式音频评论\\n上述段落英文原文为：NotebookLM Plus : Upload more source files (PDFs, audio, websites) and get structured summaries, including podcast-style audio reviews for complex topics\\nPython代码解释器：在安全环境中运行和测试代码，可直接导出图表或数据文件用于报告或作业\\n上述段落英文原文为：Python Code Interpreter : Run and test code in a safe environment, and export charts or data files directly for reports or assignments\\nGemini学生免费版不仅仅是一个折扣价格。从在Gmail和Docs中的无缝使用，到NotebookLM和Python解释器等高级工具，它构建了一个完整的学术生产力系统——专为帮助学生提高工作效率、更清晰地思考以及轻松管理复杂任务而设计。\\n上述段落英文原文为：The Gemini student free offer is more than just a discounted price. From seamless use inside Gmail and Docs to advanced tools like NotebookLM and the Python interpreter, it creates a complete academic productivity system—built to help students work faster, think more clearly, and manage complex tasks with ease.\\n<quark-heading level=\"2\">Gemini学生计划 vs. Google AI专业版（标准计划）</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"2\">Gemini Student Plan vs. Google AI Pro (Standard Plan)</quark-heading>\\n如果您担心学生版本可能是一个\"简化版\"或功能缩水的计划，这个对比应该能帮您理清思路。下表详细对比了Gemini学生计划和标准Google AI专业版订阅的各个方面。\\n上述段落英文原文为：If you’re worried that the student version might be a “lite” or cut-down plan, this comparison should clear things up. The table below shows a full side-by-side breakdown of the Gemini Student Plan and the regular Google AI Pro subscription.\\n<quark-table><table><tbody><tr><td>主要功能</td><td>Gemini学生计划</td><td>Google AI专业版</td></tr><tr><td>价格</td><td>免费/年（12个月免费）</td><td>每月19.99美元（约每年240美元）</td></tr><tr><td>AI模型</td><td>Gemini 3 Pro、Nano Banana、Veo 3.1</td><td>Gemini 3 Pro、Nano Banana、Veo 3.1</td></tr><tr><td>云存储</td><td>2TB Google One高速存储</td><td>2TB Google One高速存储</td></tr><tr><td>家庭共享</td><td>❌ 不支持（仅限学生账户）</td><td>✅ 支持（可与最多5名家庭成员共享2TB）</td></tr><tr><td>学生身份验证</td><td>必需（通过SheerID验证）</td><td>非必需</td></tr><tr><td>适用账户类型</td><td>仅限个人Google账户（@gmail.com）</td><td>个人或家庭Google账户</td></tr><tr><td>工作区集成</td><td>✅ 支持</td><td>✅ 支持</td></tr></tbody></table></quark-table>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-table><table><tbody><tr><td>Key Features</td><td>Gemini Student Plan</td><td>Google AI Pro</td></tr><tr><td>Price</td><td>$0 / year (12 months free)</td><td>$19.99 / month (about $240 / year)</td></tr><tr><td>AI Models</td><td>Gemini 3 Pro, Nano Banana, Veo 3.1</td><td>Gemini 3 Pro, Nano Banana, Veo 3.1</td></tr><tr><td>Cloud Storage</td><td>2TBGoogle One high-speed storage</td><td>2TBGoogle One high-speed storage</td></tr><tr><td>Family Sharing</td><td>❌ Not supported (student-only account)</td><td>✅ Supported (share 2TB with up to 5 family members)</td></tr><tr><td>Student Verification</td><td>Required (via SheerID)</td><td>Not required</td></tr><tr><td>Eligible Account Type</td><td>Personal Google account only (@gmail.com)</td><td>Personal or family Google account</td></tr><tr><td>Workspace Integration</td><td>✅ Supported</td><td>✅ Supported</td></tr></tbody></table></quark-table>\\n如您所见，除了不支持家庭共享外，学生计划提供的AI功能与每月19.99美元的标准计划完全相同。Google不会因为计划是免费的而在模型质量、推理能力和生成速度方面进行限制。\\n上述段落英文原文为：As you can see, aside from the lack of family sharing , the student plan gives you the same AI capabilities as the standard plan that costs $19.99 per month . Google does not limit model quality, reasoning ability, or generation speed just because the plan is free.\\n简而言之，如果您符合学生身份，您就能获得完整的Google AI专业版体验——而无需支付月费。\\n上述段落英文原文为：In short, if you qualify as a student, you get the full Google AI Pro experience —without paying the monthly fee.\\n<quark-heading level=\"2\">谁可以获得Google AI专业版免费使用？（学生资格要求）</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"2\">Who Can Get Google AI Pro for Free? (Student Eligibility)</quark-heading>\\n要作为学生免费激活Google AI专业版，您必须满足Google设定的特定资格条件，并通过SheerID验证。\\n上述段落英文原文为：To activate Google AI Pro for free as a student , you must meet specific eligibility rules set by Google and verified through SheerID .\\n如果您符合以下所有条件，则有资格获得免费使用：\\n上述段落英文原文为：You are eligible if you meet all of the following:\\n✅ 年满18岁\\n上述段落英文原文为：✅ You are 18 years old or older\\n✅ 是当前在读的大学或学院学生\\n上述段落英文原文为：✅ You are a currently enrolled college or university student\\n✅ 使用个人Google账户申请（非学校管理账户）\\n上述段落英文原文为：✅ You apply using a personal Google account (not a school-managed account)\\nGemini学生免费计划目前在全球52个地区提供服务，包括美国、英国、日本、印度、巴西以及大多数欧洲国家。\\n上述段落英文原文为：The Gemini free for college students program is currently available in 52 regions worldwide , including the United States, the UK, Japan, India, Brazil , and most European countries.\\n要确认您的国家是否支持学生Google AI免费服务，请查看\\n上述段落英文原文为：To confirm whether your country supports Google AI free for students , check\\nGoogle官方支持地区列表。\\n上述段落英文原文为：Google’s official list of supported regions .\\n<quark-heading level=\"2\">非学生如何以更低成本使用Gemini 3？</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"2\">How Non-Students Can Use Gemini 3 at a Lower Cost?</quark-heading>\\n如果您不是学生但仍希望以更低价格长期使用Gemini 3 Pro，GamsGo是目前最经济实惠的替代方案之一。\\n上述段落英文原文为：If you’re not a student but still want long-term access to Gemini 3 Pro at a lower price, GamsGo is one of the most cost-effective alternatives available.\\nGamsGo是一个拥有超过5年运营历史的订阅共享平台。它提供：\\n上述段落英文原文为：GamsGo is a subscription-sharing platform with over 5 years of operating history . It offers:\\n强大可靠性：被全球超过100万用户信赖，拥有稳定可靠的记录和良好的声誉\\n上述段落英文原文为：Strong reliability : Trusted by more than 1 million users worldwide , with a stable track record and solid reputation\\n一站式省钱：除了Google AI专业版外，GamsGo还为Netflix、Spotify、YouTube Premium、Duolingo等服务以及开发工具如Cursor提供折扣\\n上述段落英