t verification and claim the student offer before January 31, 2026 . If you miss this deadline, you won’t be able to unlock the full free period.\\n<quark-heading level=\"2\">如何在学生试用期结束后续订或继续使用Gemini 3？</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"2\">How to Renew or Continue Using Gemini 3 After the Student Trial?</quark-heading>\\n12个月学生免费试用期结束后，除非您提前取消订阅，否则计划将自动切换到付费月度订阅。目前的标准价格约为每月19.99美元。\\n上述段落英文原文为：After the 12-month student-free period ends, the plan will automatically switch to a paid monthly subscription unless you cancel it in advance. The current standard price is about $19.99 per month .\\n如果您希望继续免费使用Gemini 3或以更低的成本使用，以下是您的主要选择：\\n上述段落英文原文为：If you want to continue using Gemini 3 for free or at a lower cost, here are your main options:\\n免费延期（仅限部分地区）\\n上述段落英文原文为：Free extension (limited regions)\\n美国、英国、日本、印度尼西亚和巴西的学生可能通过重新验证学生身份获得额外12个月的免费使用时间。\\n上述段落英文原文为：Students in the United States, the United Kingdom, Japan, Indonesia, and Brazil may be able to get another 12 months free by re-verifying their student status.\\n低成本替代方案\\n上述段落英文原文为：Low-cost alternative\\n对于这些地区以外的学生——或者对于不再符合学生身份的用户——GamsGo提供了一个更经济实惠的选择。您可以以每年约25美元的价格使用Gemini 3 Pro，这大大降低了长期使用成本。\\n上述段落英文原文为：For students outside these regions—or for users who are no longer students— GamsGo offers a more affordable option. You can use Gemini 3 Pro for around $25 per year , which greatly reduces long-term costs.\\n最好在试用期结束前检查您的订阅状态并尽早做出决定。这样可以帮助您避免错过免费延期或意外被收费。\\n上述段落英文原文为：It’s best to check your subscription status before the trial ends and make a decision early. This helps you avoid missing a free extension or being charged unexpectedly.\\n<quark-heading level=\"2\">Gemini 3学生计划值得吗？</quark-heading>\\n上述段落英文原文为：<quark-heading level=\"2\">Is the Gemini 3 Student Plan Worth It?</quark-heading>\\n绝对值得。对于符合条件的大学生来说，Google AI Pro（包括Gemini 3 Pro）是一个几乎没有缺点的高价值优惠。\\n上述段落英文原文为：Absolutely. For eligible college students, Google AI Pro (including Gemini 3 Pro) is a high-value offer with almost no downside.\\n