st, File Tools, Terminal Gateway √ Running You can customize skills and connect channels in Settings</quark-ocr>\\n如若没有 B.AI API Key ，可以登录 B.AI LLM Service 服务页面免费申请获取，点击左侧菜单栏「 API 」中，进入 API 管理页面，点击 “Create API Key” 按钮，系统将自动生成一个专属的 API Key ，将生成的密钥 API Key 粘贴到 BAIclaw 的对应输入框中即可完成配置。\\n目前 B.AI LLM 服务支持 Web3 钱包和 Web2 谷歌账户双重登录方式，所有新登录用户可免费领取 100,000 AI 积分，可用于 API 调用体验。\\n<quark-image>8</quark-image>\\n<quark-ocr>## Welcome to 3.AI, how can I help?</quark-ocr>\\n<quark-image>9</quark-image>\\n<quark-ocr>New Chat Usage © API Top up Memory API ## Quick start 01. Create API key Generate and securely save your API key 02. View examples Explore usage examples, available in CURL, Python, and Node.js 03. Make a request Integrate with BAI's AI services \\* BAI API Doc View the full API Reference and Guides ## API keys Create an API key to access BAI services in your applications. Please store it securely. Do not share your API key with others, or expose it in the browser or other client-side code. You may generate up to 3 API keys. No data ## Examples curl python nodejs Shell</quark-ocr>\\n<quark-image>10</quark-image>\\n<quark-ocr>8.AI &amp;i Create APl key Please sove this and accessible. For security reasons, you will not be able to view it ogain through your account. I you lose this kery you will need to generote a new one. k-3 xl= Cancel Copy</quark-ocr>\\n\\n<quark-ocr>New Chat Usage API Top up Memory Q: Search Topics... BAI product features an... B AI products and servi... API ## Quick start 01. Create API key Generate and securely save your API key 02. Explore usage examples, available in cURL, Python, and Node.js 03. Make a request Integrate with BAI's AI services BAI API Doc View the full API Reference and Guides ## API keys Create an API key to access BAI services in your applications. Please store it securely. Do not share your API key with others, or expose it in the browser or other client-side code. You may generate up to 3 API keys. sk-23913\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*y8ds Created 2026/4/21 16:51:17 Create API key Last Used 2026/4/23 18:58:14 ## Examples</quark-ocr>\\n<quark-heading level=\"4\">第三步：开始 AI 智能对话</quark-heading>\\n配置成功后，系统会自动跳转至 BAIclaw 的主界面。您只需在聊天框中输入问题或指令，即可开启流畅的 AI 智能交互体验。无需额外设置，无需编写代码，真正实现 AI Agent“ 开箱即用 ” 。\\n配置成功后，系统会自动跳转至 BAIclaw 的主界面。您只需在聊天框中输入问题或指令，即可开启流畅的 AI 智能交互体验。无需额外设置，无需编写代码，真正实现 AI Agent“ 开箱即用 ” 。\\n\\n<quark-ocr>what features do you have and what can you do?</quark-ocr>\\n<quark-heading level=\"3\">BAIclaw 进阶指南： AI Agent 六大核心能力解析</quark-heading>\\n从 BAIclaw 主界面左侧工具栏来看，共涵盖七大产品功能模块： Chat （智能对话： AI Agent 对话）、 Model （模型： AI API 接入）、 AI Agent （多智能体： AI Agent 创建与管理）、 Channel （社交渠道：接入社交渠道）、 Skill （技能： Skill 扩展中心）、 CronTask （任务管理：定时任务）、 Setting （设置： AI Agent 配置页面）。\\n这些产品模块协同发力，共同为 AI Agent 提供六大核心服务，全面支撑其高效运行，具体包括： AI 智能交互、多 AI Agent 智能体管理、社交渠道接入管理、 Skill 技能扩展、自动化任务管理，以及 AI Agent 一站式配置。\\n<quark-heading level=\"4\">1. AI 智能交互（ Smart Interaction ）： 自然语言对话 AI Agent</quark-heading>\\n在 BAIclaw 主界面对话框中，只需输入对话指令就可沉浸式与 AI 对话，相关 AI Agent 会自动执行任务。\\n<quark-image>13</quark-image>\\n<quark-ocr>\\+ New Chat Models Agents Channels Skills Cron Tasks Older than 1 Month Main agent:main:main ## What can I do for you? Handle Tasks Continuous Execution Multi-Agent Parallel</quark-ocr>\\n\\n<quark-ocr>## Core Capabilities Reading &amp; Writing Access files in your workspace, create/edit them I can organize, restructure, clean up your stuff Search the web (Brave API) Fetch &amp; read pages Full browser automation (scraping, form filling, testing) Run commands, write scripts Python (via uv — bundled with BAIClaw) Can spawn isolated sub-agents for complex tasks</quark-ocr>\\n<quark-heading level=\"4\">2. 多智能体管理与协作（ Multi-Agent Collaboration ）： 创建、调度与协同多个 AI Agent</quark-heading>\\nBAIclaw 支持创建与管理多个具有不同 “ 技能 ” 的 AI Agent 。用户可通过工具栏中的「 AI Agent 」界面添加或管理不同任务的智能体，每个智能体可独立配置模型、工作文件、技能集与权限，多个智能体之间也可以协作，在执行过程中只需通过 @AI Agent 指令快速切换至特定 AI Agent 。\\n<quark-image>15</quark-image>\\n<quark-ocr>Models Agents Channels Skills Cron Tasks Older than 1 Month Main agent:main:main ## Agents When adding a new Agent, BAIClaw will copy the main Agent's workspace files and runtime auth setup. The configuration can be modified through a dialog. [NO TEXT] Main ✓ default Model: claude-haiku-4.5 (inherited) Channels: none</quark-ocr>\\n<quark-heading level=\"4\">3. 社交渠道接入管理（ Channel Management ）：绑定多平台账号，统一消息通道</quark-heading>\\nBAIclaw 现已支持 Telegram 、 Discord 、 WhatsApp 、 Feishu 、 QQbot 、 WeCom 、 DingTalk 等 6 大社交平台的账号绑定，无需复杂后台配置，操作便捷高效。用户只需点击「 Channel 」工具栏中的对应社交媒体图标，按照提示完成配置即可实现账号绑定与平台切换。例如，接入 Telegram 账号时，点击 Telegram 图标后，系统会自动弹出需填写的 BotToken 和 UserID ，填写完成后即可正常使用，实现多平台消息统一管理\\n<quark-image>16</quark-image>\\n<quark-ocr>BAIclaw \\+ New Chat Models Agents Channels Skills Cron Tasks Older than 1 Month Main agent:main:main ## Messaging Channels Refresh Manage your messaging channels and connections. The configuration is only effective for the main Agent. ## Supported Channels ## Telegram Connect Telegram using a bot token from @BotFather ## Discord Connect Discord using a bot token from Developer Portal ## WhatsApp Connect WhatsApp by scanning a QR code (no phone number required) ## DingTalk Plugin Connect DingTalk via OpenClaw channel plugin (Stream mode) ## Feishu / Lark Plugin Connect Feishu/Lark bot via WebSocket ## QQ Bot Plugin Connect OO Bot via @slivern/robot plugin ## WeCom Plugin Connect WeCom Bot via plugin</quark-ocr>\\n<quark-image>17</quark-image>\\n<quark-ocr>8 BAIClaw \\+ New Chat Models Agents Channels Skills Cron Tasks Older than 1 Month Main agent:main:main ## Configure Telegram Connect Telegram using a bot token from @BotFather ## How to connect Connect Telegram using a bot token from @BotFather View Documentation 1. Open Telegram and search for @BotFather 2. Send /newbot and follow the instructions 3. Copy the bot token provided 4. Paste the token below 5. Get your User ID from @userinfobot and paste it below ## Channel Name Telegram ## Bot Token ★ ## Refresh ot token from Developer the main 123456:ABC-DEF... ⑨ Claw channel plugin (Stream Environment Variable: TELEGRAM\\_BOT\\_TOKEN ## Allowed User IDs \\* e.g. 123456789, 987654321 Comma separated list of User IDs allowed to use the bot. Required for security.</quark-ocr>\\n<quark-heading level=\"4\">4. Skills 技能扩展（ Skill Extension ）： 即插即用的 Skill 扩展库，已内置 66 Skills 技能</quark-heading>\\nBAIclaw 的 Skills 已内置 66 预置 Skills ，覆盖文档处理、代码自动化、搜索功能等 Web2 场景，还有 x402 支付、链上数据查询分析（ TronScan ）、 DEX 交易（ SunSwap ）等 Web3 链上场景，无需额外操作即可立即启动。同时，开发者可上传自定义 Skill ，经官方审核通过后可加入官方市场，进一步丰富技能生态，满足不同用户的个性化需求。\\n\\n<quark-ocr>BAIclaw \\+ New Chat Models Agents Channels Skills Cron Tasks Older than 1 Month Main agent:main:main Settings ## Skills Open Skills Folder ## Browse and manage AI capabilities 1password Set up and use 1Password CLI (op). Use when installing the CLI, enabling desktop app integration, signing in... Bundied /Applications/BA/claw.app/Contents/Resources/openclaw/skills/1password v1.0.0 apple-notes Manage Apple Notes via the 'memo' CLI on macOS (create, view, edit, delete, search, move, and export notes)... Bundied /Applications/BA/claw.app/Contents/Resources/openclaw/skills/apple-notes v1.0.0 apple.reminders Manage Apple Reminders via remindctl CLI (list, add, edit, complete, delete). Supports lists, date filters, and... Bundied /Applications/BA/claw.app/Contents/Resources/openclaw/skills/apple-reminders v1.0.0 bear-notes Create, search, and manage Bear notes via grizzly CLI. Bundied /Applications/BA/claw.app/Contents/Resources/openclaw/skills/bear-notes v1.0.0 blogwatcher</quark-ocr>\\n<quark-heading level=\"4\">5. AI 自动化任务执行（ Task ）： 可视化 Cron 配置， 7×24 小时自动执行</quark-heading>\\nBAIclaw 的 Core Task 功能提供可视化的 Cron 配置界面，用户可直观设置任务触发条件和时间间隔，让 AI Agent 实现 7×24 小时全天候自动运行，无需人工值守。典型应用场景：每日 9 点自动生成市场简报并发送至邮箱；实时监测加密货币价格波动，当出现异常时自动触发警报，助力用户及时捕捉关键信息。\\n<quark-image>19</quark-image>\\n<quark-ocr>Models Agents Channels Skills Cron Tasks Main switch the ai model mi... Today Main query the current toke... Main heartbeat Main hello Automate AI workflows with scheduled tasks ## Scheduled Tasks Main hello ① ▶ 0 00 Total Tasks 0 Active 0 Paused × 0 ## No scheduled tasks Failed Create scheduled tasks to automate AI workflows. Tasks can send messages, run queries, or perform actions at specified times. \\+ Create Your First Task</quark-ocr>\\n<quark-heading level=\"4\">6. 一站式配置 AI Agent ：可为 AI Agent 添加 Web3 智能钱包 Agent Wallet</quark-heading>\\nBAIclaw 的 Setting 模块可集中管理 BAIclaw 的通知规则、 AI Agent 设置、数据隐私选项等功能，同时支持 AI Agent 一键导出或导入配置文件，实现开发环境的快速迁移，大幅提升配置效率。\\n更重要的是，该模块可为 AI Agent 添加 Web3 智能钱包 Agent Wallet ，让 AI Agent 一键拥有 API 费用自重支付、 Token 转账、 DEX 交易、流动池管理、使用 x402 付款资源等 Web3 相关 Skills ，轻松适配 Web3 场景需求。\\n<quark-image>20</quark-image>\\n<quark-ocr>BAIclaw \\+ New Chat Models Agents Channels Skills Cron Tasks Today Main hello Main heartbeat ## Settings Configure your BAIclaw experience Language English 繁體中文 简体中文 Launch at system startup Automatically launch BAIClaw when you log in ## Web3 Configuration</quark-ocr>\\n<quark-image>21</quark-image>\\n<quark-ocr>BAIclaw + New Chat Models Agents Channels Skills Cron Tasks Today Main heartbeat Main hello Main hello ## Settings Configure your BAIClaw experience ## Create Agent Wallet Agent Wallet is a locally secure Web3 wallet built for AI agents. BAIclaw supports importing the private key associated with your current BAI API Key to create an Agent Wallet By configuring Agent Wallet, BAIClaw can enable self-recharge, transfers, token swaps, liquidity pool management, and access to x402 protocol paid resources and other Web3 skills. Learn more about Agent Wallet ## Web3 Cancel Next Agent Wallet Agent Wallet not created</quark-ocr>\\n总结来看 ， BAIclaw 是一款集 “AI 智能交互、复杂任务执行、多智能体协作 ” 于一体的全能 AI Agent 智能平台，让不同层级的用户都能轻松驾驭 AI Agent ，实现从基础使用到专业落地的全流程便捷体验。\\n它并非简单的 AI 聊天工具，而是兼顾基础需求与复杂场景的综合平台：一方面，高效满足日常 AI 对话咨询、信息检索、文案润色等基础需求，无需复杂操作即可快速获取精准反馈；另一方面，支持多 AI Agent 与 SubAgent 子智能体的协同联动，每个智能体可独立配置技能、权限与模型，通过智能路由网络实现多任务并行处理，大幅提升工作与学习效率。\\n从核心优势来看， BAIclaw 实现了 AI Agent 全方位的体验升级。操作层面，它将传统 AI Agent 复杂的终端代码操作转化为直观的图形化拖拽界面，全程无代码，三步即可完成从安装到启动的全流程，彻底降低了使用门槛。功能层面， BAIclaw 不断迭代升级，内置 66 实用技能，支持数十个全球顶尖大模型无缝切换，兼顾多智能体协作与个性化配置。场景层面，它实现了 Web2 与 Web3 的全场景适配：既覆盖日常办公、信息管理等 Web2 高频场景，也通过 Agent Wallet 智能钱包及链上技能扩展，满足加密资产交易、链上协作等 Web3 场景需求。", "publish_time": "2026年04月24日", "auth_level": "", "authority_weight": 0.0}, "397": {"url": "https://news.bitcoin.com/b-ai-launches-globally-introducing-infrastructure-for-autonomous-ai-agents-to-advance-agi/", "title": "B.AI Launches Globally, Introducing Infrastructure for Autonomous AI Agents to Advance AGI", "page_content": "本付费新闻稿由B.AI提供，非新闻稿撰写。新闻稿不必然认可本公告中的声明内容。\\n上述段落英文原文为：This paid press release was provided by B.AI and was not written by News. News does not necessarily endorse the statements made within this announcement.\\n\\n上述段落英文原文为：\\n新闻稿\\n上述段落英文原文为：PRESS RELEASE.\\n英属维尔京群岛，2026年4月9日——B.AI是一家为AI智能体时代构建的金融基础设施，今日宣布全球发布，推出集成了AI接入、支付、清算、身份认证和协调功能的全栈平台。B.AI将AI基础设施与区块链技术相结合，支持身份验证和自主支付，成功为AI智能体提供全面的端到端服务套件。通过摒弃传统开户流程（如账户注册、地理限制和信用卡支付），B.AI通过加密钱包实现AI服务的无许可访问。B.AI旨在通过构建AI智能体规模化自主运行所需的基础设施，加速通用人工智能（AGI）的发展。B.AI还充当统一网关，聚合领先的AI模型，让用户能够在单一平台上与多个服务商进行交互。\\n上述段落英文原文为：British Virgin Islands, April 9, 2026 — B.AI , a financial infrastructure built for the AI Agent era, today announced its global launch, introducing a full-stack platform that integrates AI access, payments, settlement, identity, and coordination. B.AI combines AI infrastructure with blockchain technology to support identity verification and autonomous payments, successfully delivering a comprehensive end-to-end service suite for AI agents. By removing reliance on traditional onboarding processes such as account registration, geographic restrictions, and credit card payments, B.AI enables permissionless access to AI services through crypto wallets. B.AI is designed to accelerate the development of Artificial General Intelligence (AGI) by building the infrastructure required for AI agents to operate autonomously at scale. B.AI also acts as a unified gateway for aggregating leading AI models, enabling users to interact across multiple providers in a single platform.\\nB.AI利用8004协议，这是一个链上身份系统，通过将区块链地址与可验证声誉关联起来，实现智能体对智能体（A2A）的信任机制。该协议支持去中心化注册、声誉管理和可信验证，为A2A经济奠定基础。每个AI智能体都分配有唯一且不可变的链上身份，记录着公开可追溯的历史，包括服务活动、用户反馈和技能认证。这使得此前不相识的智能体能够相互验证并规模化协作。\\n上述段落英文原文为：B.AI leverages the 8004 protocol, an onchain identity system that enables agent-to-agent (A2A) trust by linking blockchain addresses to verifiable reputations. The protocol supports decentralized registration, reputation management, and trusted verification, providing a foundation for the A2A economy. Each AI agent is assigned a unique, immutable onchain identity that records a public, traceable history, including service activity, user feedback, and skill certifications. This allows previously unacquainted agents to verify one another and collaborate at scale.\\n此外，B.AI集成了x402开放支付标准，实现AI智能体之间的自动化、无信任价值转移。基于HTTP 402框架，x402为数字服务引入了\"按访问付费\"模式，支持高频微交易、实时清算和完全自动化的工作流程。这使得AI智能体能够访问计算资源、与数据服务交互、为API付费以及执行链上交易。通过让智能体能够交换和货币化生成的输出，该系统在智能体经济内支持持续且互操作的支付循环。\\n上述段落英文原文为：Additionally, B.AI integrates the x402 open payment standard to enable automated, trustless value transfer between AI agents. Based on the HTTP 402 framework, x402 introduces a pay-to-access model for digital services, supporting high-frequency microtransactions, real-time settlement, and fully automated workflows. This allows AI agents to access compute resources, interact with data services, pay for APIs, and execute onchain transactions. By enabling agents to exchange and monetize generated outputs, the system supports a continuous and interoperable payment loop within the agent economy.\\n平台还配备了一套生态系统工具，旨在提升智能体性能。BAIclaw是一个基于OpenClaw和ClawX构建的本地化桌面应用程序，支持自主部署和多智能体协作。配套的还有MCP服务器，提供AI和区块链服务的简化访问；智能体钱包，提供加密本地密钥存储以实现安全资产管理；以及OpenClaw扩展程序，这是一个一键解决方案，将B.AI的完整Web3功能集成到现有AI智能体中，无需代码修改。\\n上述段落英文原文为：Rounding out the platform is a suite of ecosystem tools designed to enhance agent performance. BAIclaw, a locally deployed desktop application built on OpenClaw and ClawX, which enables autonomous deployment and multi-agent collaboration. Supporting this is the MCP Server, providing streamlined access to AI and blockchain services; the Agent Wallet, offering encrypted local key storage for secure asset management; and the OpenClaw Extension, a one-click solution that integrates B.AI’s full Web3 capabilities into existing AI agents without requiring code modifications.\\n此次发布恰逢AI系统正从对话型用例向更自主的执行模式发展，而底层基础设施仍存在碎片化、互操作性和金融功能有限的问题。B.AI的架构旨在通过提供标准化的接入、身份和价值转移层来解决这些约束。\\n上述段落英文原文为：The launch comes as AI systems move beyond conversational use cases toward more autonomous execution, while underlying infrastructure remains fragmented and limited in interoperability and financial functionality. B.AI’s architecture is designed to address these constraints by providing a standardized layer for access, identity, and value transfer.\\n该平台旨在让AI智能体能够作为自主经济参与者发挥作用，具备管理资产、访问服务和独立交易的能力。B.AI专注于为新兴的智能体经济构建可扩展、互操作的基础设施，长远目标是支持更先进的自主系统。随着AI与区块链的融合加速，B.AI有望支持智能体间的可扩展、无信任协作，并成为通用人工智能发展的关键催化剂。\\n上述段落英文原文为：The platform is intended to enable AI agents to function as autonomous economic actors, capable of managing assets, accessing services, and transacting independently. B.AI is focused on building scalable, interoperable infrastructure for the emerging agent economy, with the longer-term aim of supporting more advanced autonomous systems. As the convergence of AI and blockchain accelerates, B.AI is positioned to support scalable, trustless coordination between agents and serve as a key catalyst for the advancement of AGI.\\n关于B.AI\\n上述段落英文原文为：About B.AI\\nB.AI是为AI智能体时代构建的金融基础设施，旨在解决智能体在模型接入、支付、清算、身份认证和协调方面面临的核心挑战。通过统一的API和清算网络，B.AI让AI智能体能够更自由地连接到领先的全球模型和服务，同时通过智能体钱包自主进行支付、收款和价值交换。与此同时，B.AI通过链上账户为智能体构建可验证的身份和信用原语，帮助AI从软件工具演进为能够交易、协作并在大规模上持续运行的经济参与者。通过降低模型接入门槛、实现无缝价值转移并建立智能体的经济框架，B.AI旨在加速AI智能体生态系统的成熟，推进通用人工智能的现实发展，并让更广泛的用户和开发者受益于AI技术。\\n上述段落英文原文为：B.AI is a financial infrastructure built for the AI Agent era, designed to address the core cha